## 待审文本（按字段）
{
 "reply": "Hi Kevin,\n\nThank you for your inquiry about our Portable Blender Cup (model BL-35P). Below are our offer and the certification and lead-time details.\n\n1. Price\n- 2,000 units (1,000–4,999 tier): USD 6.20/unit FOB Ningbo\n- 5,000 units and above: USD 5.70/unit FOB Ningbo\nI understand your target is USD 5.20, but we can't reach that price at this quantity. If you can combine orders or plan for 5,000+ units, the USD 5.70 tier applies.\n\n2. Your logo\nPrinting your logo on the color box is free for orders above 1,000 units, so it's included at 2,000 units. Please send your logo as a vector file (AI/EPS/PDF). If you'd also like the logo on the cup itself, let me know and I'll confirm the options and cost.\n\n3. Certifications and materials\n- FCC: We do not currently have an FCC SDoC test report for this model. Our current documents are a CE (EMC) report and a UN38.3 battery test report. The UN38.3 report is useful for shipping a battery-powered product. If you need FCC for Amazon US, we can discuss arranging testing with a third-party lab, either your designated lab or one we coordinate. Cost and timing would need to be confirmed first.\n- BPA-free: The cup body is made of Tritan, and we have the material supplier's BPA-free declaration. We do not have a third-party test report on the finished product. If Amazon or your compliance team requires one, we can discuss arranging that testing as well.\n\n4. Lead time\nOur standard lead time is 35 days after deposit and artwork confirmation, so we can't commit to 25 days. Our monthly capacity is about 20,000 units, so a 2,000-unit order fits comfortably within our schedule. If any FCC or third-party testing is required, please factor that into your launch timeline.\n\n5. Product highlights\n- 350 ml capacity, 2,000 mAh battery, USB-C charging\n- 6 stainless steel blades, one-button operation\n- Safety lock: the motor won't run when the cup is detached\n- About 12 blends per charge (based on our factory testing)\n- Packing: color box, 40 units per carton\n\n6. Payment terms\n30% T/T deposit with 70% against the B/L copy, or L/C at sight.\n\n7. Samples and factory audit\n- Samples are charged at the unit price, and you cover the international freight. The sample cost is credited back against your bulk order.\n- We can arrange a live video factory tour via Alibaba video call, so you can see our production line and quality control.\n\nIf you share your logo file and confirm whether you need FCC and finished-product BPA testing, I can send a formal PI and a sample arrangement right away. We look forward to working with Brightline Home.\n\nBest regards,\nSales Team\nYongjiang Small Appliances\nNingbo, China"
}
